\ EXPAND.SEQ    Expanded memory (EMS) interface             F-PC native port

\ There is no expanded memory in the native port. The words remain so that
\ code which tests for EMS keeps working: EMM-PRESENT? is always false and
\ EMM-STATUS reports failure.

VARIABLE PAGE-FRAME
VARIABLE EMM-STATUS     TRUE EMM-STATUS !
VARIABLE USE-EMM
VARIABLE CUR_EMM_HNDL   -1 CUR_EMM_HNDL !

: EMM-PRESENT?    ( --- f1 )            FALSE ;
: EMM-STATUS?     ( --- )               EMM-STATUS ON ;
: ?EMMERR         ( --- f1 )            EMM-STATUS @ ;
: EMM-PAGE-FRAME  ( --- )               EMM-STATUS ON ;
: EMM-AVAIL-PAGES ( --- pages )         0 ;
: EMM-TOTAL-PAGES ( --- pages )         0 ;
: EMM-ALLOC-PAGES ( pages --- handle )  DROP EMM-STATUS ON 0 ;
: EMM-MAP-PAGES   ( log phy handle --- ) 3DROP EMM-STATUS ON ;
: EMM-DEALLOC-PAGES ( handle --- )      DROP ;
: EMM-GET-VERSION ( --- version )       0 ;
: ?EMM:           ( --- page-frame )    PAGE-FRAME @ ;

: EMM-INIT      ( -- )          \ initialize expanded memory driver
                -1 CUR_EMM_HNDL !  EMM-STATUS ON ;
: EMMOFF        ( -- )          USE-EMM OFF  EMM-STATUS ON ;
: EMMON         ( -- )          USE-EMM ON   EMM-INIT ;
